ork, and discipline among the participants. Furthermore, I am writing this letter to formally request the assistance of 25 ROTC officers. We believe that the presence and guidance of the ROTC officers will significantly enhance the program by providing assistance to maintain order all throughout the said event. The ROTC officers will also take part in the event which will foster participation and collaboration between the UASG and the ROTC. We are hoping for your kind and favorable consideration on this matter. Thank you very much! Very truly yours, ESTELITO T. AMAR UASG, Senator Noted by: NINIA ROSE M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG JEFFREY T. IMPORTANTE, MAEd Co-Adviser, UASG Recommending Approval: ANGEL B. BIADORA Coordinator, NSTP Approved: PORFERIO S. BANGCAYA, PhD Campus Director',251,'Proposal',30.00,'[]','[]','null','{\"method\": \"Pattern Matching\", \"category\": \"Proposal\", \"entities\": [], \"keywords\": [], \"provider\": \"Keyword Fallback\", \"sentiment\": [], \"confidence\": 30}','nlpcloud',6552,'2026-05-19 15:25:04'),(156,155,'UNIVERSITY OF ANTIQUE STUDENT GOVERNMENT tlmc.usg@antiquespride.edu.ph March 11, 2025 MR. ROY BANDOJA Director, Sports Development Unit University of Antique Tario-Lim Memorial Campus Dear Sir Roy, Warm greetings from the University of Antique Student Government! The University of Antique Tario Lim Memorial Campus Student Government (UASG) serve as the primary organization that connects the University Administration and the student body. The UASG represents the voice and interests of the students, enabling them to elect representatives to lead for the Academic Year 2025-2026. In line with this the University of Antique- Tario Lim Memorial Campus (UASG) will conduct an Acquaintance Party to strengthen relationships among students to foster camaraderie, respect, and uniting students as one community. Very truly yours, JESSICA N. DAYONOT UASG, Senator Noted by: JERU AVRIL CRYZ UASG, Vice President NINA M. ETORCITA Adviser, UASG',137,'Ac